{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-59854","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89289","text":"stackdocs — the whole [&] stack, as a filesystem you can walk"}]},{"id":"blk-59855","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89290","text":"A single, navigable documentation site that "},{"id":"spn-89291","marks":["bold"],"text":"mirrors the live repository's filesystem"},{"id":"spn-89292","text":": every real "},{"id":"spn-89293","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-89294","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-89295","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-89296","text":" markdown file across all 43 projects — plus each project's own root-level markdown, where TRVM, TRAAVIIS and WRL keep nearly all of theirs — becomes a page whose route "},{"id":"spn-89297","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-89298","text":" its source path. No files are moved. Open "},{"id":"spn-89299","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/index.html"},{"id":"spn-89300","text":" — single file, no server."}]},{"id":"blk-59856","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89301","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-59857","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89302","text":"The home page is a "},{"id":"spn-89303","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runefort campus"},{"id":"spn-89304","text":": the stack rendered as a place you can walk. Directories are floors (campus → building → floor), documents are rooms. The left rail is the real filesystem tree; the top bar is a live breadcrumb of the current path. Each document page shows its "},{"id":"spn-89305","marks":["bold"],"text":"source path"},{"id":"spn-89306","text":" (with a copy button), the rendered markdown, and a right rail of typed neighbors: outgoing links, "},{"id":"spn-89307","marks":["bold"],"text":"backlinks"},{"id":"spn-89308","text":" (\"referenced by\"), and siblings in the same folder."}]},{"id":"blk-59858","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89309","text":"Because "},{"id":"spn-89310","marks":["code"],"text":"route === source path"},{"id":"spn-89311","text":", an AI agent reading the rendered docs can round- trip back to the exact file on disk, and vice-versa. "},{"id":"spn-89312","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-89313","text":" is the machine-readable route⇄source map for exactly this."}]},{"id":"blk-59859","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89314","text":"How it dogfoods the stack (in the build, not as metaphor)"}]},{"id":"blk-59860","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89315","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89316","text":" uses the real "},{"id":"spn-89317","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-89318","text":" npm package to:"}]},{"id":"blk-59861","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59863","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89319","marks":["bold"],"text":"Mirror the filesystem"},{"id":"spn-89320","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-89321","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89322","text":" scans the repo (excluding"}]}],"id":"blk-59862","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-59864","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89323","marks":["code"],"text":"node_modules"},{"id":"spn-89324","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89325","marks":["code"],"text":"_build"},{"id":"spn-89326","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89327","marks":["code"],"text":"deps"},{"id":"spn-89328","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89329","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap"},{"id":"spn-89330","text":", and every dot-directory except "},{"id":"spn-89331","marks":["code"],"text":".claude"},{"id":"spn-89332","text":", so gitignored local state like "},{"id":"spn-89333","marks":["code"],"text":".amp/"},{"id":"spn-89334","text":" is never published), collecting every "},{"id":"spn-89335","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-89336","text":"+"},{"id":"spn-89337","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-89338","text":" "},{"id":"spn-89339","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-89340","text":" file, each project's root-level markdown, and the top-level stack docs. 350 docs / 43 projects."}]},{"id":"blk-59865","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59867","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89341","marks":["bold"],"text":"Turn each file into a validated BendScript document"},{"id":"spn-89342","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-89343","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89344","text":" parses"}]}],"id":"blk-59866","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-59868","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89345","text":"the markdown to blocks; "},{"id":"spn-89346","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89347","text":" emits BendScript; each doc is validated against the protocol schema, normalized, and "},{"id":"spn-89348","marks":["bold"],"text":"content-addressed"},{"id":"spn-89349","text":" (CIDv1). The CID is shown in the reader rail — change a file, its id changes."}]},{"id":"blk-59869","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59871","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89350","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type every cross-doc link as an edge"},{"id":"spn-89351","text":" — relative "},{"id":"spn-89352","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-89353","text":" links that resolve"}]}],"id":"blk-59870","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-59872","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89354","text":"to a known route become internal navigation; the graph is inverted to produce backlinks. Unresolvable links degrade gracefully (never fail the build)."}]},{"id":"blk-59873","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59875","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89355","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify the round-trip invariant"},{"id":"spn-89356","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-89357","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(serialize(parse(d)))"},{"id":"spn-89358","text":" is checked"}]}],"id":"blk-59874","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-59876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89359","text":"to be a CID fixpoint across the whole corpus — the protocol's load-bearing claim, now proven over 223 real documents."}]},{"id":"blk-59877","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89360","text":"The campus "},{"id":"spn-89361","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-89362","text":" Runefort's "},{"id":"spn-89363","marks":["code"],"text":"codebase-atlas"},{"id":"spn-89364","text":" idea; the pages "},{"id":"spn-89365","marks":["italic"],"text":"are"},{"id":"spn-89366","text":" BendScript's \"prose is one projection of the graph.\" The medium is the message."}]},{"id":"blk-59878","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89367","text":"Robustness: the build never breaks on real content"}]},{"id":"blk-59879","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89368","text":"Real markdown is messy. The ingest pipeline falls back to a raw code-block view for any document it can't cleanly parse, counting fallbacks in the build report (currently "},{"id":"spn-89369","marks":["bold"],"text":"0"},{"id":"spn-89370","text":"). So new or unusual docs join the atlas automatically without ever failing the build."}]},{"id":"blk-59880","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89371","text":"Build it"}]},{"id":"blk-59881","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"npm i                 # box-and-box + @bendscript/core\nnpm run build         # node build-atlas.mjs → dist/index.html + dist/atlas.json + dist/bend/*\nnpm run build:curated # the earlier 21-page curated proof (node build.mjs)"},{"id":"blk-59882","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89372","text":"Build report (actual output):"}]},{"id":"blk-59883","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ✓ 350 real docs mirrored from 43 projects (no files moved)\n  ✓ route === source path for every page (lossless agent round-trip)\n  ✓ 360 cross-doc links resolved to internal navigation\n  ✓ every page is a validated, content-addressed BendScript document\n  ✓ round-trip CID fixpoint holds across the corpus: true\n  ✓ 0 doc(s) fell back to raw view (unparseable markdown)"},{"id":"blk-59884","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89373","text":"Extending it"}]},{"id":"blk-59885","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59887","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89374","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add docs:"},{"id":"spn-89375","text":" just add markdown under any project's "},{"id":"spn-89376","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-89377","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-89378","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-89379","text":". The"}]}],"id":"blk-59886","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-59888","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89380","text":"next build picks it up — it joins the tree, the floors, search, and the graph."}]},{"id":"blk-59889","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59891","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89381","marks":["bold"],"text":"Point an agent at it:"},{"id":"spn-89382","text":" read "},{"id":"spn-89383","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-89384","text":" for the "},{"id":"spn-89385","marks":["code"],"text":"route ⇄ source"}]}],"id":"blk-59890","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-59892","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89386","text":"mapping, or read any "},{"id":"spn-89387","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/bend/<slug>.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-89388","text":" for the content-addressed BendScript form of a single file."}]},{"id":"blk-59893","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89389","text":"Files"}]},{"id":"blk-59894","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59896","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89390","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89391","text":" — the filesystem-mirror build (primary)"}]}],"id":"blk-59895","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59898","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89392","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89393","text":" — repo scan → filesystem tree + route↔source map"}]}],"id":"blk-59897","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59900","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89394","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89395","text":" — markdown → BendScript blocks (with raw-view fallback)"}]}],"id":"blk-59899","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59902","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89396","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89397","text":" — BendScript → HTML, link resolution"}]}],"id":"blk-59901","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59904","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89398","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.css"},{"id":"spn-89399","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-89400","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.js"},{"id":"spn-89401","text":" — the Runefort campus client"}]}],"id":"blk-59903","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59906","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89402","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/"},{"id":"spn-89403","text":" — built site ("},{"id":"spn-89404","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-89405","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89406","marks":["code"],"text":"atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-89407","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89408","marks":["code"],"text":"bend/*.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-89409","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-59905","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59908","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89410","marks":["code"],"text":"build.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89411","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-89412","marks":["code"],"text":"content.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89413","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-89414","marks":["code"],"text":"sources.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89415","text":" — the earlier curated 21-page proof"}]}],"id":"blk-59907","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieran5fhegfx53cmaz6tjzfogarqrdrwvb5kajxmty4cxiax3kfnb4jq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}